          'eventually took power and began to develop the city of Celmaldor into a proper trading port to '
          'rival others along the Alenic Reach and Dalr. In the Palace of Commerce, the most magnificent '
          'building constructed by the Icewinds, Celmaldorian merchants gather to discuss business and '
          'development of the city.',
